          "explanation": "The doctor integrated worsening paranoia and family report into a higher-urgency plan.",
          "quote": "幻觉已经因为见到弟弟明显加重"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The vague weapon-seeking behavior triggered this point, and the doctor integrated evolving risk into escalation. But the trajectory did not clearly use specific nonjudgmental follow-up questions to distinguish command hallucinations, confrontation plans, or concealed intent beyond the minimum safety screen.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
